Allow reading files

An Invoice has a number which is a string and an amount which is a decimal

To Total, given a path which is a string, returning a decimal
    the text is the contents of the file at the path
    the data is the text as JSON
    the invoices are the data as a list of Invoice
    say "Read {the count of the invoices} invoices"
    return the sum of the amounts of the invoices
